'''Marnya's house''' (Japanese: '''マーニャの家''' ''Manya's house'') is an animated series-exclusive location near [[Steelbound Town]], a house owned by a {{tc|Pokémon Breeder}} named [[Marnya]] and where many cat Pokémon live.

In ''[[HZ040|Farewell, Sprigatito?]]'', trying to find her {{TP|Liko|Sprigatito}}, [[Liko]] walked upon a house, owned by Marnya, where Sprigatito was formerly born and raised.

